{"id":"644817","name":"粿条卷蘸酱油","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/644817/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"粿条卷","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"香葱洗净切葱花备用。","img":"images/644817/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"蒜头拍扁剁碎备用。","img":"images/644817/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"买的市场带芝麻的粿条卷。","img":"images/644817/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中热油放入蒜末小火慢炒。","img":"images/644817/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"蒜末炒香至微微金黄，加入生抽。","img":"images/644817/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅拌均匀，加入适量清水和盐煮开。","img":"images/644817/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"煮开后关火加入葱花备用。","img":"images/644817/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"粿条卷切小段放入盘中。","img":"images/644817/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅中水烧开放入粿条卷，大火蒸5分钟左右。","img":"images/644817/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"蒸好后淋上酱油即可。","img":"images/644817/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/644817/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/644817/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/644817/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/644817/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}